    {
      "name": "startup order mirrors SmartHealth handshake",
      "source": "YCBTEncoderTest.kt",
      "command": {
        "op": "startupSequence",
        "params": {
          "profile": "ycbt",
          "metric": true,
          "is24Hour": true,
          "languageCode": 0,
          "heightCm": 175,
          "weightKg": 70,
          "sex": "other",
          "ageYears": 25,
          "hrIntervalMinutes": 5
        }
      },
      "logical": [
        "02 00 47 43",
        "02 01 47 46",
        "02 07 43 46",
        "01 12 00",
        "01 04 00 00 00 00 00 00",
        "01 0c 01 1e",
        "01 26 01 1e",
        "01 03 af 46 00 19",
        "03 09 01 00 02"
      ],
      "frames": [
        "02 00 08 00 47 43 6f ec",
        "02 01 08 00 47 46 9b 16",
        "02 07 08 00 43 46 da 17",
        "01 12 07 00 00 02 c8",
        "01 04 0c 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 24 03",
        "01 0c 08 00 01 1e 96 85",
        "01 26 08 00 01 1e 8c cb",
        "01 03 0a 00 af 46 00 19 e0 3a",
        "03 09 09 00 01 00 02 a0 de"
      ],
      "note": "Default startupSequence() (R10M / YCBT profile, baseline capabilities). Kotlin asserts the (group, cmd) order 02 00, 02 01, 02 07, 01 12, 01 04, 01 0c, 01 26, 01 03, 03 09 and the last command 03 09 01 00 02 in full; \"startup sends no health delete or retired get opcodes\" asserts no group 05, no 05 40..4e, no 02 24/26/28 and no 02 1b. The Lumen default profile (175 cm, 70 kg, 25 y, sex other -> 0) is what Lumen sends when the person has no profile."
    },
